{"4083140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Red Season", "steam_appid": 4083140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intense Combat - Brutal Stealth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult members see, hear, and work as a group menace. Divide and isolate them using sound lures like bricks, bottles and scavenged items from the environment before striking.   <br>Use stealth to ambush cultists, crush them in savage melee, or unleash raw loud firepower when things fall apart.  <br>Every fight is quick, violent, and personal, no safety, no forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/0b67e0a51045f44292415db4c0022960.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After his daughter is taken by a sadistic folk horror cult, one man sets out to hunt them to the last, through fields, barns, a decayed town and blood-soaked ritual sites,   <br>Red Season is a dark, relentless stealth‑action game about vengeance and sacrifice where every step closer to the truth drags you deeper into the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Sanity, Morality, and the Cost of Revenge</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/6820ed40bb2440532f90b7165b02db66.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each clue  about your daughter’s fate changes you.<br>Some truths heal; others hollow you out.<br>As your sanity slips, so does your sense of justice. Can you still tell if you’re saving her… or just becoming another monster in the dark? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Oldschool Visuals, Modern Gameplay</strong><br><strong> </strong><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/d4c48298159b610c78589ddb0f1274ec.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Red Season blends retro PS1/PS2 aesthetics with modern third‑person controls and gameplay.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap freely between third‑person and first‑person cameras anytime during the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch shoulders to get the best angle on every shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change stances — walk, run, sprint, crouch, go prone, or crawl — to traverse the surroundings.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Inspirations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Season is an ode to third‑person horror and shooter classics such as <i>Manhunt</i>, <i>Kane &amp; Lynch 2</i>, <i>Resident Evil 4</i>, <i>Dead Space</i>, and <i>The Last of Us</i> — while telling its own unique story of vengeance, sacrifice, and the darkness in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intense Combat - Brutal Stealth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/2f2e570311e930dd43d9d4e53923e3d3.mp4?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cult members see, hear, and work as a group menace. Divide and isolate them using sound lures like bricks, bottles and scavenged items from the environment before striking.   <br>Use stealth to ambush cultists, crush them in savage melee, or unleash raw loud firepower when things fall apart.  <br>Every fight is quick, violent, and personal, no safety, no forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.poster.avif?t=1765242747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/extras/f7953291865010d42aa62d6c49e1ff0b.webm?t=1765242747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/408314