i>Resident Evil 4</i>, <i>Dead Space</i>, and <i>The Last of Us</i> — while telling its own unique story of vengeance, sacrifice, and the darkness in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Red Season is a brutal third-person stealth-action game set in the storm-soaked countryside of 1998. Hunt the cult that kidnapped your daughter with violent takedowns, savage melee and intense gunfights. Face the horrors as you walk the fine line between justice and becoming a monster.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Latin America, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/00439e9724b3f9f960743e5db4021925263eaaca/header.jpg?t=1765242747", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/d6d5d745e51a297eb9d72c4e7d09eb99f4eb546f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765242747", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083140/d6d5d745e51a297eb9d72c4e7d09eb99f4eb546f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765242747", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD Ryzen 3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB VRAM or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM or more<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available